---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const title = "Privacy Policy | Editors Gurukul";
export const category = "editing-fundamentals";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Editors Gurukul" description="How Editors Gurukul collects and uses data, including Google Analytics, Google Translate, and affiliate links — read the full privacy policy.">


  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: July 2026</em></p>
      <p>This website respects your privacy. We do not sell your personal data, and we only collect information that is necessary for site operation, analytics, and improving the content we publish.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-top:28px;">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you visit the site, basic technical data such as browser type, approximate location, device type, and pages visited is collected automatically for site performance and analytics purposes. If you contact us directly (email, Instagram, YouTube), we use the information you share only to respond to your message — we do not share your details with third parties for marketing without your consent.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-top:28px;">Cookies, Analytics &amp; Google Translate</h2>
      <p>This site uses <strong>Google Analytics (GA4)</strong> to understand how visitors use the site — pages viewed, time on page, and general traffic sources. Google Analytics uses cookies and may collect your IP address and device information. You can opt out using browser extensions like <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>
      <p>The optional "हिंदी में पढ़ें" (Hindi translation) feature is powered by the <strong>Google Translate</strong> widget. Clicking it sets a cookie and loads a script from Google's servers to translate the page — Google's own <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy</a> governs that data.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-top:28px;">Affiliate &amp; Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Some pages (for example, camera and gear guides) contain <strong>affiliate links</strong> — including Amazon Associates links. If you click through and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. Product recommendations reflect our own testing and opinions, not sponsorship, unless explicitly stated on that page.</p>
      <p>External links to YouTube, Instagram, and other third-party sites are provided for convenience — once you leave this site, that platform's own privacy policy applies.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-top:28px;">Advertising</h2>
      <p>This site does not currently run third-party display ads. If that changes in the future, this policy will be updated to disclose the ad network used and how it uses cookies before ads go live.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin-top:28px;">Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy or your data? Reach out via the <a href="/about-contact.html">About / Contact</a> page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  



</Layout>
